<li>Understand that heat therapy is a comfort enhancement, not medical treatment</li>
<li>Discuss your specific needs with an HCM specialist to determine Kozue vs. KaZe Duo fit</li>
</ol>
<p style="margin-bottom:18px"><strong style="color:var(--ink)">HCM's Role:</strong> JP Medics offers two flagship-tier models with distinct buyer profiles. The Kozue ($15,999) is optimized for sensor-led precision with 5D rollers and 27 live pressure sensors. The KaZe Duo ($12,999) is optimized for dual-engine convenience with voice control, wireless charging, and wall-saver design. HCM's product specialists help match your body type, use case, intensity preference, space constraints, and budget to the right model.</p>
